# internal/bundled/modules is build output: `make plugins` writes one <id>.wasm.gz
# and one <id>.manifest.json here for every module under plugins/*/, and .gitignore
# keeps every one of them out of the repository (ADR-0059 decision 10).
#
# This file is the only thing committed in the directory, and it is committed so
# that the directory EXISTS in a fresh clone — internal/bundled embeds it, and an
# embed pattern that matches nothing is a compile error rather than the specific
# "run make plugins" failure a clone is supposed to get.
